完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Consistency, the expanded language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(A)\">\\(L(A)\\)</span>, and the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> designated free variables are supplied by the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_S\\)</span> predicate rather than reintroduced with a second formula arity.</li>\n<li>The model5 type-over-set variant is retained as an alias with empty background theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ (partial $n$-type candidate over $A$, see [[../batch10/58-df-type.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,A,T,L,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2TypeOverSet}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5TypeOverSet}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}type\\text{-}over\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2TypeOverSet}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\\le